{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends will be launched into the world of Birddawg X. Players will traverse the canyon map (level 1) in search of rings and ammo. The pick-ups are spread across the level and it is your duty to collect 50+ rings in order to unlock the championship ring. In New York City (level 2) collect 100+ rings, then on the moon (level 3)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly through the skies and stall out your competitor by shooting them with arrows until their health is depleted.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GoodLuck on the battle field players. All the best.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491190?t=1740511724","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491190?t=1740511724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491190/fa7c551f4abfda4af24e16bc3cf3006770ca3671/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740511724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491190/fa7c551f4abfda4af24e16bc3cf3006770ca3671/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740511724","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends will be launched into the world of Birddawg X. Players will traverse the canyon map (level 1) in search of rings and ammo. The pick-ups are spread across the level and it is your duty to collect 50+ rings in order to unlock the championship ring. In New York City (level 2) collect 100+ rings, then on the moon (level 3)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly through the skies and stall out your com